# English (US) translations for the Conexão BR Irlanda theme.
# The theme's source language is pt_BR; this catalog translates its static
# UI strings into natural English. STAGE 1 SCOPE: a curated subset covering
# the i18n-foundation surfaces (recurrence labels, navigation overrides, SEO
# title/description patterns, breadcrumb root, JavaScript UI strings).
# Untranslated entries deliberately fall back to the Portuguese source so
# nothing half-translated is ever emitted. These translations are NOT active
# on the public site in Stage 1 (pt_BR is the only public language; no /en/
# routing exists yet — see CONEXAO_BR_ENGLISH_STAGE_1_REPORT.md).
